    11	
    12	For each extension, the score is the number of uppercase characters minus the
    13	number of lowercase characters. The result is the class name, `"."`, and the
    14	first extension with maximal score. Strict `>` in the scan retains the earlier
    15	extension on ties. The implementation additionally defines the empty-list
    16	result as `class_name + "."`.
